{'symbol': 'EA', 'date': '2021-12-14 12:02:00', 'title': 'MLS AND ELECTRONIC ARTS REVEAL 2022 EMLS SEASON FEATURING 27 MLS CLUBS, RETURN TO LIVE EVENTS, 350 HOURS OF LIVE COVERAGE', 'text': 'NEW YORK & REDWOOD CITY, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #EA--MAJOR LEAGUE SOCCER (MLS) AND ELECTRONIC ARTS (NASDAQ: EA) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPETITIVE SCHEDULE AND DETAILS FOR THE 2022 SEASON OF EMLS, THE OFFICIAL ESPORTS LEAGUE OF MAJOR LEAGUE SOCCER. KICKING OFF IN JANUARY 2022, THE SEASON WILL FEATURE 27 PROFESSIONAL EA SPORTS™ FIFA PLAYERS, EACH REPRESENTING AN MLS CLUB, ON THE VIRTUAL PITCH AS THEY COMPETE FOR THEIR SHARE OF THE RECORD-SETTING $75,000 SEASON PRIZE POOL. IF ONGOING PANDEMIC CONDITION'}